  "releaseNotes": "0.6.9: HeifEdits renders the Photos sliders and the Portrait blur in one call (HeifDocument.Render, Image.ApplyHeifEdits), sliders first so edits can precede the blur; HeifDocument.LoadPortraitMaps loads depth and matte once for several variants. Breaking change: HeifPortrait, HeifPhotosEdit and RenderPortrait are removed (migration table in the notes). Rendered pixels are unchanged. Requires PictureSharp 0.7.6. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp.Heif/blob/v0.6.9/docs/releases/release-0.6.9.md",
